{"id":"n58163-5-6","stage":0,"title":"세우다 · 磨","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58163-5-6-1","ko":"돌은 왜 찾아?","zh":"你找石头干什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"돌은","meaning":"笨蛋，石头","explanation":"돌：笨蛋，石头；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"돌","audio":"/audio/c7e6ac93ca8c5b84f5c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62589","senseId":"2","lemma":"돌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찾아?","meaning":"寻，觅，访，寻找，查","explanation":"찾다：寻，觅，访，寻找，查；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"1","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c7e6ac93ca8c5b84","term":"돌","zh":"笨蛋，石头","audio":"/audio/c7e6ac93ca8c5b84f5c9.mp3","entryId":"62589","definition":"(贬称)迟钝或不好使的脑子；或指迟钝或脑子不好使的人。","pronunciation":["돌ː"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"0aa19509314fd879","term":"찾다","zh":"寻，觅，访，寻找，查","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3","entryId":"57320","definition":"为了得到某物或为了见某人而四处查找；或指得到此物或见此人。","pronunciation":["찯따"]}],"audio":"/audio/4423da930cb77e908566.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58163-5-6-2","ko":"칼이 잘 안 들어서 날 좀 세우려고.","zh":"刀钝了，想磨一磨刀刃。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"칼이","meaning":"刀","explanation":"칼：刀；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"칼","audio":"/audio/4eaedee29619f832b4df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26905","senseId":"1","lemma":"칼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，了不起地","explanation":"잘：很好地，了不起地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entr